BT /F2 7.4 Tf 42.00 452.00 Td (1. Everything is a File or Process:) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.200 rg
BT /F1 7.1 Tf 189.00 452.00 Td (In Linux, devices, disks, network sockets, and configs are all accessed via filesystem paths!) Tj ET
0.100 0.400 0.150 rg
BT /F2 7.4 Tf 42.00 440.00 Td (2. Small Tools Connected by Pipes:) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.200 rg
BT /F1 7.1 Tf 189.00 440.00 Td (The Unix philosophy: write modular programs that do ONE task well. Connect them with pipes \(|\).) Tj ET
0.100 0.400 0.150 rg
BT /F2 7.4 Tf 42.00 428.00 Td (3. Respect Root Power:) Tj ET
0.200 0.250 0.200 rg
BT /F1 7.1 Tf 189.00 428.00 Td (Root \(UID 0\) has no guardrails and can delete your whole system in 1 second. Double-check commands!) Tj ET
0.100 0.400 0.150 rg
